<%--
Da_Base - the parent <Define>. Its class/role/tabindex/title are the default attributes
that must reach every subclass, however the subclass inherits the TEMPLATE.

title="define default" exists for the empty-string case: an invocation title="" is SET,
and the old falsy test (`if (!this.$.attr(key))`) could not tell it from absent.
--%>
<Define:Da_Base class="card" role="region" tabindex="-1" title="define default">
  <div class="da-body"><%= content('body') %></div>
</Define:Da_Base>
